# BHOC — Knowledge Library

**Biological Hemoglobin Oxygen Carrier (BHOC)** — a research and development platform for hemoglobin-based oxygen therapeutics.

---

## 📚 Library Structure

The library is organized into three main application areas. Each area contains its own bibliography (regulatory data, clinical evidence, research studies) and market insights.

| Area | Description | Link |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **🐾 Veterinary** | Approved veterinary applications (Oxyglobin). Clinical cases, regulatory dossiers. | [↗](/veterinary/README.md) |
| **🫀 Transplant** | BHOC for organ perfusion, preservation, and transportation. | [↗](/transplant/README.md) |
| **🧬 Human Use** | Historical trials, current research, regulatory status. | [↗](/human-use/README.md) |

